External data & services (user-brought, never redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------

- Navigraph navdata: user-licensed via Navigraph subscription. Flight
  Studio parses files the user already owns; the data never ships with
  the app or this repository.
- SimBrief OFPs: user account data, imported via OAuth2 on demand.
  Never redistributed.
- OpenStreetMap map tiles: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL
  (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Fetched at runtime from
  public tile servers; not bundled.
- OurAirports data: Public Domain (https://ourairports.com/data/).
- FAA CIFP / NASR: Public Domain (U.S. Government work).
- ChartFox aviation charts: user account API token; chart PDFs are
  opened in the user's browser under ChartFox's own terms
  (https://chartfox.org). Never redistributed or mirrored.
- aviationweather.gov (METAR/TAF): U.S. government public data.
- Letta (cloud or local): user account/API key; conversation data
  stays in the user's local Letta store (~/.letta) by default.

The dependency list above reflects the current development branch;
some entries may drift as versions update. For the authoritative and
up-to-date license inventory, generate a report from the lockfiles:

  Flutter:  flutter pub deps --style=list  (then check each package on
            pub.dev)
  Gateway:  npm licenses --prefix agent_gateway

Some transitive dependencies are omitted for brevity; their licenses
ship inside each package on pub.dev / npm.
